'''Vainglorious Venture''' (虚栄カンパニー ''Kyoei Kanpanī'', '''Vanity Company''') is the 27th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 125th sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
Consists of two gimmick stages that combine similar enemies ([[Shoddy Fix]] and [[Affairs of Another]]) along with other straightforward stages that can be beaten with moderate difficulty. [[Insufficient Evidence]] and [[Miraculously On Time]] can be challenging due to their inclusion of strong pushers such as [[Commander Ostromeda]] and [[Relic Bun-Bun]]. Beyond that, this sub-chapter can be considered somewhat simple.

